  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec424975c73c62f4aa54fb055eac9a7f, type: 3}
  m_Name: MazeIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueObject
  dialogue:
  - Welcome to HeartSleeves!
  - 'In our state of the art matching system, we collect all of our user''s data,
    and use advanced algorithms to create an ideal match between users. '
  - 'Please wait while we gather your data. '
  - ...
  - ...
  - ...
  - Our system has encountered an error.
  - We are unable to contact our servers at this time to gather your data.
  - 'Not to worry! We will instead have you navigate through this maze. '
  - 'As you navigate, we will determine your problem solving ability, intelligence
    level, etc. '
  - 'We have 3 checkpoints for you through the maze. Once you reach a checkpoint,
    we will set you up with a date using the data we have gathered so far. '
  - 'This maze is challenging, so if you get lost, sorry about that but just keep
    going! '
  - Good luck, and may you find love no matter what!
  - ...
  - Also! Forgot to mention, but as you are currently signed up for our free plan,
    you may see pop up ads throughout the game.
  responses: []
